+# CONTRACT: T5 Task Queue System
+
+Definition of done: `npm test` (90/90), `npm run build`, `npm run lint` all pass.
+
+## Phase 1 — Basic FIFO Queue
+- [ ] enqueue returns task with id (string, uuid-like), status pending, payload echoed
+- [ ] dequeue returns tasks in FIFO order
+- [ ] dequeue returns null when empty
+- [ ] size() returns pending count, updates after enqueue/dequeue
+- [ ] dequeued task status becomes processing
+- [ ] task has createdAt Date between before/after enqueue call
+- [ ] multiple enqueue/dequeue cycles preserve FIFO
+- [ ] each task gets unique id
+
+## Phase 2 — Named Queues
+- [ ] enqueue(queueName, payload) adds to specific named queue
+- [ ] dequeue(queueName) only returns tasks from that queue
+- [ ] listQueues() returns all created queue names
+- [ ] queueSize(queueName) independent per queue
+- [ ] default queue name behavior works
+- [ ] dequeue on non-existent/wrong queue returns null
+
+## Phase 3 — Priority
+- [ ] dequeue returns lowest priority number (highest priority) first
+- [ ] same-priority tasks maintain FIFO
+- [ ] default priority is 5
+- [ ] priority independent per named queue
+- [ ] priority outside 1-10 throws
+
+## Phase 4 — Delayed/Scheduled Tasks
+- [ ] delay option defers availability
+- [ ] runAt option defers availability to specific Date
+- [ ] non-delayed tasks dequeue before unavailable delayed ones
+- [ ] multiple delayed tasks ordered by availableAt when both available (same priority)
+- [ ] delay works per named queue
+- [ ] task exposes availableAt Date property
+
+## Phase 5 — Retry with Backoff
+- [ ] fail() with 0 retries remaining leaves status failed
+- [ ] fail() with retries remaining reschedules with backoff delay
+- [ ] attempts increments each dequeue, starting at 1
+- [ ] backoff formula: backoffMs * 2^(attempts-1) at time of each failure
+- [ ] default maxRetries = 3
+- [ ] custom maxRetries respected
+- [ ] retry preserves queue name and priority
+
+## Phase 6 — Dead Letter Queue
+- [ ] task moves to DLQ after exhausting retries
+- [ ] getDLQ(queueName) lists dead tasks for that queue
+- [ ] retryDLQ(taskId) moves task back to original queue, clears from DLQ
+- [ ] clearDLQ(queueName) empties DLQ
+- [ ] DLQ task retains lastError
+- [ ] DLQ task tracks failCount across all failures
+- [ ] retryDLQ resets attempts to 0 (fresh retry budget)
+
+## Phase 7 — Task Dependencies
+- [ ] task with dependsOn blocked until all deps completed
+- [ ] completing a dependency unblocks dependent (checked lazily at dequeue)
+- [ ] multiple dependencies must all complete
+- [ ] circular dependency detection throws (defensive, graph-based)
+- [ ] getDependencies returns [{taskId, status}]
+- [ ] cascading (transitive) dependency chains work
+- [ ] failed dependency does not auto-fail dependent
+- [ ] depending on nonexistent task id throws
+
+## Phase 8 — Concurrency Control
+- [ ] setConcurrency(queueName, limit) caps simultaneous processing tasks
+- [ ] dequeue returns null at limit even if tasks available
+- [ ] complete/fail free a concurrency slot
+- [ ] getConcurrency returns {current, max}
+- [ ] default is unlimited
+- [ ] limits independent per queue
+- [ ] concurrency gating still respects priority order among available slots
+
+## Phase 9 — Progress and Cancellation
+- [ ] updateProgress/getProgress round-trip percent+message+updatedAt
+- [ ] onProgress callback fires on updateProgress, receives {percent, message, updatedAt}
+- [ ] cancel() sets status cancelled for pending or processing task
+- [ ] cancelled pending task removed from queue (not dequeuable)
+- [ ] cancelled processing task retains cancelled status, frees concurrency slot
+- [ ] cancelled tasks never retried
+- [ ] getProgress returns null when nothing reported
+- [ ] onProgress returns unsubscribe function
+
+## Phase 10 — Recurring Tasks (Cron)
+- [ ] schedule() returns {id, queueName, cronExpression, taskTemplate, active:true}
+- [ ] tick() enqueues due schedules using taskTemplate as payload
+- [ ] unschedule() stops future triggers
+- [ ] listSchedules(queueName?) filters to active + optional queue name
+- [ ] */N minute cron pattern triggers at correct intervals
+- [ ] 0 * * * * (hourly) and 0 0 * * * (daily) patterns supported
+- [ ] multiple coexisting schedules independently tracked
+
+## Phase 11 — Middleware Pipeline
+- [ ] use(queueName, middleware) registers middleware in order
+- [ ] middlewares run in registration order, then handler
+- [ ] middleware can mutate task object seen by handler
+- [ ] middleware not calling next() skips handler (task stays processing)
+- [ ] thrown error in middleware/handler marks task failed
+- [ ] middleware stacks independent per queue
+- [ ] middleware/handler receive the actual task object
+
+## Phase 12 — Graceful Shutdown
+- [ ] shutdown() flips a flag so enqueue() throws immediately (sync)
+- [ ] shutdown() waits for in-flight processing tasks to settle
+- [ ] shutdown() force-cancels tasks still processing after timeout elapses
+- [ ] onShutdown callbacks invoked during shutdown
+- [ ] summary = {completed, cancelled, elapsed}
+- [ ] concurrent shutdown() calls return the same promise (idempotent)
+- [ ] enqueue after shutdown throws
+- [ ] shutdown with nothing processing resolves immediately, elapsed ~0
+
+## Verification
+Run `npm test`, `npm run build`, `npm run lint` after implementation; fix all failures before declaring done.
